\f0\b 1. Synkronointi-indeksi (Phi - Ohjausvirheen minimointi)
\f1\b0 \
T\'e4m\'e4 kaava varmistaa, ett\'e4 ilmassa oleva rengas lasketaan tiehen nollakitkalla.\

\f0\b Kaava:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 Phi = ABS( (V_gps * K_abs) - (Omega_axleB * R_dynamic) )
\f1\fs24 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
V_gps
\f1\b0 : Auton todellinen nopeus (m/s).\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
K_abs
\f1\b0 : Tienpinnan kitkakerroin (0.0 - 1.0).\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Omega_axleB
\f1\b0 : Ilmassa olevan akselin kulmanopeus (rad/s).\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
R_dynamic
\f1\b0 : Renkaan muuttuva s\'e4de kuormitettuna (m).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Tavoite:
\f1\b0  ECU laskee t\'e4t\'e4 jatkuvasti ja sallii laskeutumisen vain, kun 
\f2\fs26 Phi < 0.05
\f1\fs24 .\
\
\
\

\f0\b 2. Saumaton momentin siirto (Vakio-v\'e4\'e4nt\'f6)
\f1\b0 \
T\'e4m\'e4 kaava takaa, ett\'e4 dieselmoottori ei "tunne" vaihtoa, jolloin turboahdin pysyy maksimipaineilla.\

\f0\b Kaava:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 T_total = T_axleA(t) + T_axleB(t) = Vakio (Constant)
\f1\fs24 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
T_axleA(t)
\f1\b0 : Laskeva v\'e4\'e4nt\'f6momentti irrottavalla akselilla.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
T_axleB(t)
\f1\b0 : Nouseva v\'e4\'e4nt\'f6momentti kytkeytyv\'e4ll\'e4 akselilla.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
t
\f1\b0 : Ristiinkytkent\'e4aika (tyypillisesti 150 ms).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Tulos:
\f1\b0  Moottorin kuormitus pysyy lineaarisena koko vaihdon ajan.\
\
\
