\f0\b 3. Synkronointiteho (e-Sync Power)
\f1\b0 \
Laskee s\'e4hk\'f6moottorilta vaadittavan tehon akselin kiihdytt\'e4miseksi ilmassa.\

\f0\b Kaava:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 P_sync = (J * Alpha) / Eta
\f1\fs24 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
J
\f1\b0 : Akseliston hitausmomentti (kg*m^2).\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Alpha
\f1\b0 : Tavoiteltu kulmakiihtyvyys (rad/s^2).\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Eta
\f1\b0 : S\'e4hk\'f6j\'e4rjestelm\'e4n hy\'f6tysuhde.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
