\f0\b \cf0 4. Energian talteenotto (KERS Recovery)
\f1\b0 \
Laskee generaattorin jarrutusmomentin, kun akseli nousee ilmaan.\

\f0\b Kaava:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 T_regen = (0.5 * J * Omega^2) / Delta_t
\f1\fs24 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
